{"schema":"tm-fgo-event-shard-v1","chapterId":"fgo-part1-okeanos","orderIndex":1,"eventId":"okeanos-event-B","rawEventCode":"事件B","rawTitle":"迦勒底海盗","rawTime":"1573年4月3日 午后","trigger":"到达特异点","completion":"命令海盗船驶向海盗岛","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/part1/ch-003-okeanos.txt#event-B"],"participants":["藤丸立香","玛修","罗曼医生","海盗"],"summary":"众人降落在海盗船上并制服船员。得知指南针失效且附近有海盗岛。玛修命令海盗船朝该岛航行。","dialogueRefs":[{"speaker":"罗曼医生","quote":"如果像鲁滨逊一样被灵子转移到荒岛上，有可能二十八年后才有人来救你们吧。","ref":"sources/worldbook-script/part1/ch-003-okeanos.txt#event-B:quote-01"},{"speaker":"海盗","quote":"是『遵命，女士』才对！","ref":"sources/worldbook-script/part1/ch-003-okeanos.txt#event-B:quote-02"}]}
